<title>USA: Creative Tech completes reverse split.</title>
<headline>Creative Tech completes reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creative Technologies Corp said on Friday that the one-for-three reverse stock split approved at its annual shareholders' meeting became effective.</p>
<p>The company also said that it has entered into an agreement to become the exclusive U.S. importer and distributor for Soehnle of Germany, a manufacturer of scales.</p>
